title Team Lunch Order

component lunch-webapp as "Lunch Order Web" web-application
component lunch-api as "Lunch Order API" service
component lunch-db as "Lunch Database" database

east user-auth as "Thunder Auth" identity-server

north -> lunch-webapp
north -> lunch-api

lunch-webapp -> lunch-api
lunch-webapp -> user-auth
lunch-api -> user-auth
lunch-api -> lunch-db
